{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JnnyD9Q6U5jxpeNeDp9aPz","type":"tool_result","content":"430:### 9. MCP Surface\n465:Tool surface discipline: ten new memory tools is a meaningful cognitive load for clients. Before shipping Phase 8, audit whether `propose_memory_evolution` + `apply_memory_evolution` can collapse into a single tool with an `action` parameter, and whether `verify_memory` + `explain_memory` can be unified. The goal is the smallest surface that covers all assistant workflows. Consolidate before stabilizing the MCP contract."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"589d9a30-530c-4e7c-8151-20cc70f1285a","uuid":"40c4d859-621c-4196-8761-48e7873140a2","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:39:57.512Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"430:### 9. MCP Surface\n465:Tool surface discipline: ten new memory tools is a meaningful cognitive load for clients. Before shipping Phase 8, audit whether `propose_memory_evolution` + `apply_memory_evolution` can collapse into a single tool with an `action` parameter, and whether `verify_memory` + `explain_memory` can be unified. The goal is the smallest surface that covers all assistant workflows. Consolidate before stabilizing the MCP contract.","numLines":2}}
